    "coverage": "Viewed every page and cover in eight 3×3 contact sheets, then re-viewed every corrected sheet. Full-size checks: 0083 p08, 0086 p07, 0087 p08.",
    "notes": [
      "0081: shore support at opening; golden sliver belongs to neighboring leaf, snow revealed only after standing on the other leaf.",
      "0082: three consistent colored stones, red then yellow then blue; brush endpoints connected to hands; backpack removed in bed.",
      "0083: lamp stays green during current spring story; one striped and one dotted shell, exactly three laugh bubbles; prone otter fully within frame.",
      "0084: a single sleeve feather causes the laugh before moving to pocket; hidden drawing, cat ear revision and inserted letter remain in order.",
      "0085: mill stays supported on floor; coarse grains retained in sieve, fine flour beneath, repeated grinding and cooling cake shown.",
      "0086: two cloth pieces before sewing; one sewn flag after; opposite-side views in two explicit panels; removed floating background characters and duplicate cover flag.",
      "0087: exactly six paper leaves, no doubled skirt; green shoes preserved while seated; wrapped cake paper is yellow and occupied leaves remain undisturbed.",
      "0088: three soup leaves, sieve over sand, earlier sifted leaf/stone piles and recovered spoon; white shared spoon and personal wooden spoon distinguished."
    ],
